omer et \u00eatre au plus pr\u00e8s des planches dessin\u00e9es.", "short_description": "Izneo est un service cross-plateformes permettant de lire des Mangas, BD, Webtoons et Comics.\nPour utiliser l'application vous devez poss\u00e9der un compte izneo (\u00e0 cr\u00e9er sur www.izneo.com).\nConnectez-vous \u00e0 votre compte et retrouvez vos albums \u00e0 lire en r\u00e9alit\u00e9 virtuelle dans des environnements configurables."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "1080x360_bg.png", "id": "1205263993211836", "image_type": "APP_IMG_SMALL_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982727_1205263996545169_9148883512724487229_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=rTOn3CM_oEUQ7kNvwEiHq95&_nc_oc=Adp3HRqHtsfFDIxLmEnbkFpchvtBWxo7Xn_dE8ntP8TdUUVOGv-KegGSsdB6m2J3iJo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQJ8spsHxZG_2LkdPPKcNSoHLeAhteHlJUAbwwtGiIHyXA&oe=6A9ED6B4"}, {"file_name": "512.png", "id": "1050334919080944", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38984471_1050334922414277_3741888985697961122_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=1UmzXLXRqxUQ7kNvwGxjdMq&_nc_oc=AdofzgoYX1KwtA_GQwPpogWsaswigWazemW4GiD6iPO7rkxiO6e2p0g_EXyArfTIybI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQLpZ4iCsxnE_iKUSdrzDlPL3n4mVpw8CmFZAq7rX_gLHA&oe=6A9ED816"}, {"file_name": "2560x1440_bg.png", "id": "715429989842664", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982580_715429993175997_4462372464006952430_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=TJYd5DkN-aQQ7kNvwFKrpBH&_nc_oc=AdqgKgRO4hhc2WIUYuAbHMYMfq_sf_6cXg1X_PQTg10JQGWI0KwyUIKusB2JtWI6DIM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQIsoYZeuZsYWi7vgPOCZdW5oCd0h_5TXcAZd9GZZDehrQ&oe=6A9EB4F7"}, {"file_name": "3000x900_pdp-art-safezone.png", "id": "629709414781356", "image_type": "APP_IMG_HERO", "uri": "https://